units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1 origin 0 0 0 spacing 3.3008 3.3008 3.3008
region simulation_box block 0 66.016 0 66.016 0 213.048 units box
create_box 1 simulation_box
region initial_solid block 0 66.016 0 66.016 0 198.048 units box
create_atoms 1 region initial_solid
mass 1 92.90638
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
region projectile_initial block 0 66.016 0 66.016 132.032 198.048 units box
group projectile region projectile_initial
group target subtract all projectile
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press vol
thermo_modify flush yes lost error
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian units box
fix equilibration all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
velocity projectile set NULL NULL -20 sum yes units box
fix production all nve
run 0
